{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_01",
  "title": "逃离与追逐",
  "storyCode": "FC-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fd83dd93fe116939b86825017eac1d0195023993d602962b86f49a9271cb7677",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别翻你那账本了，还想着过几天回去推上你的小车卖东西呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，不敢想，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是做了亏心事，我就总觉得要记下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生都是聪明人，受的是什么伤，她看一眼就知道啦。既然她没责怪你，那就是原谅你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可她说自己不是医生，只是在卖药的地方上班，学过一些急救知识，所以能指挥我们处理伤口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么知道她说的是实话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我说，她不是一般的医生，但更不可能是什么卖药的。她带的药品种类那么齐全，又出现在荒地上，多奇怪啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸对了，她手提箱里都装了什么，你看清楚了吗？你是做生意的，东西值多少钱，你心里有数吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没仔细看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你总不能连救命恩人的行李都想抢吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，我就是随便问问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......你那里还有面包吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没多少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还是分我一个吧，拜托了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，不对，你不喜欢别人叫你医生......那个，吃块面包吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，一本古旧的塔拉诗歌集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，哦，原来是塔拉语......我本来就不认识多少词，写出来的塔拉语我就更没见过啦，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想坐在这里的话，没关系的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好，呃...\n...其实我就是想为昨晚的事情谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我只是给了一些药。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......清洗伤口，包扎，那些事情，我该自己做的。只是，我还做不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，那伤口我也不敢碰，确实吓人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但我是想说，要不是你放了那把火，我们恐怕都脱不了身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，火不是我放的，我只是路过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，既然你这么说，那就当是巧合好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，什么深池，那些当兵的把不听话的人都叫做深池。我们也就算了，你这样的好心人，不该背上这么重的罪名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你很憎恨深池？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我说不上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是从城里来的，我还是给你提个醒吧。前段时间，深池的人来过这一带。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说他们跟维多利亚的一支军队撞上了，结果维多利亚人没一个活下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这件事把城里的老爷们气坏了，所以他们从特伦特郡调了一批当兵的出来，在石高原野上四处抓人，村子也烧了好几座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......其实你真不该救我们，不值得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我如果，不去在乎别人的生命，那我答应罗德岛的事，就没有做到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？不好意思，你说话声音实在太小了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，没什么......你刚刚说的情况，我知道一些，路上我会小心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你这就要走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，天已经亮了，我不用你们指路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，好吧。我明白，像你这样，把维多利亚语讲得很标准的塔拉人，都不肯跟我们多说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你们见到凯莉了吗？差不多这么高的女人，走路时尾巴摇摇晃晃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没见到？那可以麻烦你在这附近找找吗，医生？她一晚上没回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞尔蒙，你的态度怎么突然——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，维恩，你到我这边来帮忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g3_swamp_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，这里有信号？那是不是意味着我们又找错方向了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来是。这附近的通信设施没被破坏，说明他们没有朝这一带前进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......那罗德岛有没有说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和新闻里说的没什么差别。昨晚有一小队深池士兵在红脊镇放火，烧了驻军处的一幢楼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那队士兵看起来还没有逃到这片荒野上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的都是无效信息。近一个月，所有移动城市都恰好远离这片荒地，外勤干员没有报告任何明显的异常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也只是见到了战斗留下的痕迹......从那些痕迹中，几乎无法判断战斗的规模。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯一能看出的是，交战双方的实力悬殊，那一队维多利亚士兵几乎是迅速战败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......风笛，你在听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到你零件装错了方向，就知道你又走神了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，陈陈，你居然连破城矛的结构都能看明白了！我当时可是学了好久才记住怎么维护它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......结构我倒是没有完全看懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚刚在想，休斯为什么在信里说话总是像另一个人一样，虽然这么说好像没什么道理......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好，我相信你一向直觉很准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是觉得他总有什么话想说不敢说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就好像我们上次去找过他之后，就有什么人盯上他了一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，就是这种感觉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那说明我们没有走错路。休斯给我们的消息是准确的，准确到引起了敌人的警觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行军路线可以隐藏，但战备相关原材料的流向还是泄露了信息。在过去几个月内，被我们标记的几支深池的部队都在靠近这一带。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特伦特郡外面的......无人区？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈陈，你怎么突然警......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三点钟方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和小丘郡那个时候打扮一样......是鬼魂部队！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快跟上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，风笛......他们看起来很奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，只有几个人站在荒野上，像是站岗一样......是诱饵吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，可能未必。他们让我想起一些......在龙门发生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别轻敌，我们慢慢靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
